        "created_at": "2021-02-26T16:52:21.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It depends on the PDF reader program.  Some PDF readers let you save a copy that's still editable.  I use PDF-XChange Viewer, which works just fine.  IIRC FoxIt does, too.</p>",
