        "created_at": "2021-02-28T05:23:01.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I have one form fillable PDF saved as “master copy” in more than one folder and when i start building a character i save the current form fillable PDF as the new character’s name, or test, or something.<br>\nBefore we got the form fillable auxiliary sheet i made 3 extra sheets for my form changer one for base and then his 3 other forms, all as 4 different character sheets all in one folder under his name</p>",
